ont-heading","accordion_text":"<p>As the body ages, natural collagen levels decline, leading to reduced elasticity, wrinkles, and dryness. Calmerceuticals Premium Liquid Collagen is designed to combat these effects, targeting dull, tired-looking skin and visible signs of ageing.<\/p><p>Each serving contains 10,000mg of Type 1 hydrolysed marine collagen, clinically proven to improve skin elasticity and reduce wrinkles. Enriched with hyaluronic acid, Cultavit®, polyphenols, and essential vitamins C and D, it delivers deep hydration and supports optimal collagen performance within the body.<\/p><p>Crafted with the highest quality ingredients in Australian laboratories, Calmerceuticals ensures safety, efficacy, and superior results. A daily sachet helps rebuild and restore collagen levels, boosting your body’s natural collagen and hyaluronic acid production. Each box contains 14 ready-to-drink sachets for convenient, effective beauty support.<\/p>","accordion_page":"","padding_bottom":0}},"divider_tR8fPG":{"type":"divider","settings":{"show_line":true,"padding_bottom":0}},"product_accordion_PMFRX8":{"type":"product_accordion","settings":{"show_description":false,"show_read_more":true,"open_by_default":false,"enable_full_width":false,"tabs_bg_color":"","show_accordion_divider":false,"line_thickness":"normal","accordion_heading":"How To Use","heading_style":"font-heading","accordion_text":"<h3><strong>Recommended Usage<\/strong><\/h3><p><strong>Take whenever:<\/strong> One sachet every day is all you need!<br\/><br\/><strong>Consistency Matters:<\/strong> It is recommended to stick to minimum 4-6 weeks and continue with daily use to experience Verisol enhanced benefits.<\/p>","accordion_page":"","padding_bottom":0}},"divider_tDa8RC":{"type":"divider","settings":{"show_line":true,"padding_bottom":0}},"product_accordion_KpdcJF":{"type":"product_accordion","settings":{"show_description":false,"show_read_more":true,"open_by_default":false,"enable_full_width":false,"tabs_bg_co